# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contact form (Web3Forms) — optional override
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The contact form posts to Web3Forms so messages land straight in your inbox.
# An access key is already configured in `src/components/Contact.jsx`, so the
# form works out of the box. The key is public by design and safe to ship in
# client-side code.
#
# To rotate or override the key without editing the component, copy this file
# to `.env` and set `VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY` below — or add the same variable in
# your hosting provider (e.g. Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment).
#
# Get/replace a key at https://web3forms.com (no account required).
#
# Note: Vite only exposes variables prefixed with `VITE_`.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
